s's  passion project into a personal fortune  anyway what a guy a particular taste  Mills has no trouble rounding up buyers  for his new menagerie of monsters Baloo  was a VIP target Claire and Owen were  recruited to save but it wasn't a  charity mission at all Owens behavior  research with blue is important because  he endo Raptor was created won't work as  is he wants to make another one that  grows up with blue so that it can pick  up a trainer traits of empathy and  emotional intelligence  the prototype thus displayed and them  wisely auctioned off by Mills is a  merciless  killing machine that won't be any good  to a squadron of soldiers running with  it  Owen and Claire could easily walk away  from the fray at Lockwood's estate once  they get the Pachycephalosaurus to break  them out but instead Owen decides to  hang around long enough to ensure Wu's  gene-spliced monstrosity won't ever  leave the manor alive that's when all  hell breaks loose at the Lockwood  auction twisted family tree what Maisie  spends a whole life being cared for by  the ailing secretive man she knows as  her grandpa but he refuses to even show  her a photo of the mother she supposedly  lost a lander in his care after he's  executed by Mills she discovers that  she's a clone of his late daughter and  not actually his granddaughter in other  words it's not just dinosaur DNA that's  creating new life in the story  human beings are also right for the  cloning process now blues on the move as  Mills auction starts to fall apart most  of the dinosaurs are still locked up in  the lower containment area that'll be  all well and good for everyone on site  except that the frakerz eventually  reaches the lower levels when wu demands  are zero and franklin steal bloo's blood  so we can save it for the next horror  hybrid he decides to create the two  refuse and let Palouse loose on the lab  guards but saves them and the raptor  eventually rescues Owen Claire and  Maisie above from the interrupter 